; Two marks out, the 84 is not dominated (the boundary of S-0170-a and S-0089-b).
; Cluster B of docs/cross-game.md.
;
; Needing two marks, a made 84 wins the match and a made 42 does not, so the 42 is
; not at least as good in every outcome. This form fails, and `silas query` prints
; the outcome that refutes it: the hand made. Which bid is right two marks out is a
; comparison over deals under a field (slices 3 and 4), not a dominance.
(dominates two-marks-out
  (contracts (marks 1) (marks 2))
  (frame (scoring marks 7) (short 2))
  (utility match-win))
